<title>USA: United Waste Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>United Waste Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Mos Ended     Three Mos Ended</p>
<p>				     Mar 31, 1997	  Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> Revenues			   $95,579,528	   $69,580,498</p>
<p> Net income			   8,834,862	     5,777,584</p>
<p> Earnings per share			0.21		    0.15</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p> equivalent shares		 42,706,664	    39,073,352</p>
<p>NOTE:  United Waste Systems Inc said its earnings per share for the first quarter of 1997 was $0.24 before deducting $0.03 per share in one-time charges related to the five poolings-of-interests transactions completed during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
